<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Valety | Automated Engineering Audit</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 font-sans">

    <header class="py-20 px-6 text-center bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4">Valety</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
            The standalone Windows Service that stops <b>Scope-Bleed</b>. 
            Instant AI-powered audits for Engineering Proposals & Design Reports.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="#download" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Download Service</a>
            <a href="https://t.me/YOUR_TELEGRAM_BOT" class="border border-slate-300 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-slate-100 transition">Try on Telegram</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="py-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
        <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Zero-UI Workflow</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">No complex software. Executives simply Telegram a document to get a professional audit report instantly.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Local & Secure</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Runs as a standalone Windows service. Your engineering data stays within your firm's environment.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">100% Traceability</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Every finding cites the exact page and paragraph of the reference documents. No hallucinations.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="download" class="py-16 bg-slate-900 text-white text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Get Started</h2>
        <p class="mb-8 opacity-80">v1.0.0 for Windows 10/11 x64</p>
        <a href="VALETY_INSTALLER.exe" class="bg-white text-slate-900 px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition transform inline-block">
            Download Installer (.exe)
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs opacity-50">SHA-256: [YOUR_HASH_HERE]</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="py-12 text-center text-slate-500 text-sm">
        <p>Interested in becoming a Referral Broker? <b>Earn 20% commission.</b></p>
        <p class="mt-2">Contact: <a href="mailto:your-email@domain.com" class="underline">your-email@domain.com</a></p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
